        <h3 id="scan-example-title">Find the probe instead of losing the reading.</h3>
        <p>
          When a probe stops answering, the driver asks once more, then sweeps the bus read-only. A unit that answers
          the temperature/moisture registers and a valid pH register is the THP probe; one without pH is the TH probe.
        </p>
        <p class="note">soil_probes.cpp · SoilProbes::scan</p>
