        <h3>A response is evidence. Accuracy needs more.</h3>
        <p>
          On 17 November, separate single-query tests returned valid responses with one probe in water, dry soil and the
          same soil after wetting. The moisture register changed after wetting. Temperature and moisture units follow
          the seller manual; these checks do not establish calibration, accuracy or reliable long-term operation.
        </p>
        <p>
          On 21 November, the production firmware ran on the 12 V adapter with both probes reporting good readings in
          air and uploads acknowledged by the cloud. Readings in air are not soil measurements. Cable routing,
          protection, sealed joints and suitability for burial are checked during installation.
        </p>
